Change: Primary buttons use the brand colour

Primary buttons were drawn in dark blue with light grey text and a turquoise
border. They now carry the brand turquoise #00E4BD as their fill, with text
and border in dark blue (#26384d) at 7.31:1.

Under the pointer and with keyboard focus the button still switched back to
the old dark blue with white text. Both states now keep the brand colour and
only darken the fill to #00c9a7. Text and border stay #26384d and reach 5.65:1
on it. Keyboard focus additionally draws the global outline #262B45, which
reaches 6.55:1 against this fill and 13.87:1 against the page.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 1.4.3 and SC 1.4.11
